		{
			"id": "PIidCY0D",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -226.05347465520657,
			"y": -359.8531340358837,
			"width": 792,
			"height": 75,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
			"fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aAG",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1165549535,
			"version": 522,
			"versionNonce": 720465919,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772784337406,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "A Lamport clock is a logical clock that assigns a numerical timestamp to\nevents to preserve their causal ordering.\nEach process keeps a counter.",
			"rawText": "A Lamport clock is a logical clock that assigns a numerical timestamp to events to preserve their causal ordering.\nEach process keeps a counter.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "UVV3qwJZ",
			"originalText": "A Lamport clock is a logical clock that assigns a numerical timestamp to events to preserve their causal ordering.\nEach process keeps a counter.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
		{
			"id": "XOwEKXwn",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -460.81209619409185,
			"y": -291.20167075698845,
			"width": 682,
			"height": 350,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "aC",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 713741759,
			"version": 379,
			"versionNonce": 692641631,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1772784426618,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "# Rules\n\n1. Before every event increment the count\n    example: A event -> count 0\n             A event -> count 1\n\n2. When sending a message attach the timestamp\n    example: Send message with timestamp = 2\n\n3. When receiving a message update the clock with this formula\n    clock = max(local_clock, received_timestamp) + 1\n    example: B clock = max(0,2) + 1\n             B clock = 3\n    ",
			"rawText": "# Rules\n\n1. Before every event increment the count\n    example: A event -> count 0\n             A event -> count 1\n\n2. When sending a message attach the timestamp\n    example: Send message with timestamp = 2\n\n3. When receiving a message update the clock with this formula\n    clock = max(local_clock, received_timestamp) + 1\n    example: B clock = max(0,2) + 1\n             B clock = 3\n    ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "# Rules\n\n1. Before every event increment the count\n    example: A event -> count 0\n             A event -> count 1\n\n2. When sending a message attach the timestamp\n    example: Send message with timestamp = 2\n\n3. When receiving a message update the clock with this formula\n    clock = max(local_clock, received_timestamp) + 1\n    example: B clock = max(0,2) + 1\n             B clock = 3\n    ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
